=== how many arm x checkpoint x metric contrasts exist, and how many are 'significant'? ===
 contrasts vs ctl2: 135, p<0.05: 46 (34.1%); expected under the null 5%
 Bonferroni threshold 0.00037;  smallest p=1.67e-15
 PLB2 score@20k p=0.0091 -> Bonferroni over the 135-test family: p_adj=1.000
